# A stand-in for the avohq/avo#610 reporter's .gitignore, not a copy: a React
# Native .gitignore with the rules that matter for that repo. Under the
# minimatch 5.1.9 that a fresh `npm i -g avo@3.7.0` resolves, ignore-walk lets
# the `!**/.yarn/...` negation lines reopen node_modules, Pods and build.

# Xcode
**/build/
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser
xcuserdata
DerivedData
**/.xcode.env.local

# Android
android/app/release/
.gradle
local.properties
*.keystore
!debug.keystore
android/app/.cxx

# node.js
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log

# CocoaPods
**/Pods
/vendor/bundle/

# Detox
tests/e2e-tests/output
tests/e2e-tests/artifacts

# Yarn
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/sdks
!**/.yarn/versions
